+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. No policy document, README, CONTRIBUTING guide, or changelog in this repository states or ratifies a specific scheme (e.g. SemVer, CalVer), so none should be assumed until one is explicitly documented.
